---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TratamentoDistancia from '../components/TratamentoDistancia.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Tratamento Espiritual"
    description="O GEPT realiza o atendimento espiritual fraterno e passes magnéticos, proporcionando amparo, acolhimento e equilíbrio para o corpo e a alma."
>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative pt-24 pb-16 px-4 overflow-hidden bg-brand-blue">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue via-brand-blueDark to-blue-900 opacity-90"></div>
            <!-- Optional subtle pattern -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(255,255,255,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:24px_24px]"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 md:w-48 md:h-48 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-white/20 shadow-2xl flex-shrink-0 bg-white flex items-center justify-center text-brand-blue p-2">
                <img src="/images/09-maos_Jesus.jpg" alt="Mãos de Jesus" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full" />
            </div>
            <div class="text-white text-center md:text-left">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md mb-6 border border-white/20 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-100">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path></svg>
                    Instituto da Mediunidade
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight drop-shadow-md">
                    Tratamento Espiritual
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed font-light">
                    Atendimento espiritual fraterno e passes presenciais ou online (via Zoom).
                </p>
                <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center md:text-left md:justify-start">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/10 px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                        <span class="font-medium">Quarta-feira - 19h45</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-gray-50 min-h-screen">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">

            <!-- Seção Tratamento à Distância -->
            <div class="mb-20 flex flex-col gap-6">
                <TratamentoDistancia />

                <!-- Reunião Pública Online Box (More Discrete) -->
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 md:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-gray-800">Reunião Pública</h3>
                        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Terças-feiras • 20h00</div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                            Acompanhe as palestras abertas transmitidas ao vivo pelo YouTube, com passe magnético e fluidificação das águas à distância.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/osgept" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-red-50 text-red-600 border border-red-200 px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-sm hover:bg-red-100 transition w-full md:w-auto">
                            Assistir no YouTube
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Seção Tratamento Presencial -->
            <div>
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800">Tratamento Presencial</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
                    <!-- Step 1 -->
                    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-2xl hover-card shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50">
                        <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-xl mb-4">1. Triagem Fraterna</div>
                        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Segundas-feiras • 20h00</div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Atendimento por ordem de chegada. Diálogo individual para acolher quem busca ajuda e esclarecer o funcionamento do tratamento da Casa.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Agendamento prévio ou na recepção.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 2 -->
                    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-2xl hover-card shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 border-t-4 border-t-blue-300">
                        <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-xl mb-4">2. Reunião Pública</div>
                        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Terças-feiras • 20h00</div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Palestras abertas com passe magnético e fluidificação das águas após o estudo, realizadas no centro espírita.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 3 -->
                    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-2xl hover-card shadow-sm shadow-gray-200/50 border-t-4 border-t-brand-blue">
                        <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-xl mb-4">3. Tratamento Espiritual</div>
                        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Quartas-feiras • 20h00</div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Tratamento destinado exclusivamente aos pacientes que já passaram pela triagem (na segunda-feira).
                        </p>
                        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Apresente o cartão na recepção.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tratamento Infanto-Juvenil -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-lg shadow-gray-200/40 relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-brand-blue transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-3"></div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start relative z-10">
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Tratamento Infanto-Juvenil</h2>
                            <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-brand-blue font-semibold text-sm mb-6">
                                Sábados • 8h20
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                                <div class="space-y-4">
                                    <p>
                                        O tratamento infanto-juvenil acontece aos sábados pela manhã. 
                                        <span class="block mt-2 font-medium text-red-600 bg-red-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-red-100">
                                            É necessário chegar um pouco antes das 8h20 (exatamente nesse horário a porta é fechada).
                                        </span>
                                    </p>
                                    <p>Os pais conversam na triagem sobre a criança ou jovem que fará o tratamento.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="space-y-4 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                                    <p>Enquanto isso, as crianças vão para salas específicas e os pais ficam em um espaço próprio para eles.</p>
                                    <div class="h-px w-full bg-gray-100 my-3"></div>
                                    <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                                        Ao final, todos recebem o passe magnético.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
